@@ -150,4 +150,8 @@ uses an ordinary non-force push. If the target branch advances, rerun from its
 new baseline instead of rebasing the old lock update. The CI tool does not
 become a runtime flake input.
 
-See the [shared guard contract](https://github.com/vpsfreecz/confctl/blob/5436d3d7c36d3d5174eab3c44e3578830749d3db/docs/flake-inputs.md#guarded-automated-updates) for supported sources and failure behavior.
